  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Focus (GF) series of conferences concerning the pressure facing Civil Society 2018-2019</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The key outcomes will be twofold: 1) discovering concrete pathways for CSOs to counter &#x2018;shrinking space&#x2019; as well as coordinating the strategic effort of the sector, also in relation to the Danish effort at international level in general; and 2) bringing attention to the subject of &#x2018;shrinking space&#x2019; and thereby raising public awareness.</narrative>
  </description>
